    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Investment Thesis · February 2026</div>
    <h1>Biology is the<br><em>Next Substrate.</em></h1>
    <div class="hero-sub">Paired with silicon for biology-native<br>prediction and closed-loop adaptation.</div>
    <p class="hero-thesis">
      Silicon delivered the digital age. Its limits are now thermodynamic and architectural. Biology has solved these constraints for four billion years — self-assembling, self-repairing, running at ~20W while outperforming any exascale system on continual learning and robust generalisation. The interface revolution underway is humanity acquiring the API to that substrate.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>Base Case</strong>Biology-native drug screening & NAMs</div>
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>Upside</strong>Specialised adaptive coprocessors</div>
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>Window</strong>Data moat forming now · 2026–2027</div>
    </div>
  </div>
